If the sides are $a,b$, then $ab=2a+2b$, so $(a-2)(b-2)=4$. Both sides must exceed $2$, since otherwise $ab\le2b<2a+2b$ after relabelling. The unordered factor pairs are $(1,4)$ and $(2,2)$, giving side pairs $(3,6)$ and $(4,4)$. The distinct areas are $18,16$, whose sum is $\boxed{34}$.
