The three corner triangles $ABE,ECF,FDA$ have area fractions $\dfrac{1}{2}\cdot\dfrac{5}{7}=\dfrac{5}{14}$, $\dfrac{1}{2}\cdot\dfrac{2}{7}\cdot\dfrac{1}{3}=\dfrac{1}{21}$, and $\dfrac{1}{2}\cdot\dfrac{2}{3}=\dfrac{1}{3}$. Their sum is $\dfrac{31}{42}$, leaving $\dfrac{11}{42}$ for $AEF$. Its area is $1764\cdot\dfrac{11}{42}=\boxed{462}$.
