If each removed triangle has legs $t$, the octagon sides are $1-2t$ and $t\sqrt2$. Regularity gives $t=\dfrac{1}{2+\sqrt2}$. Removing four triangles gives area $1-4\cdot\dfrac{t^2}{2}=1-2t^2=\boxed{2\sqrt2-2}$.
