Unfold the reflections into unit squares. The ray is $y=\dfrac{5}{8}x$, whose first subsequent lattice point is $(8,5)$ because $5,8$ are coprime. Folding back, an even horizontal coordinate reaches the left side, and an odd vertical coordinate reaches the top. Thus the next corner is the $\boxed{\text{upper-left}}$.
\begin{asy}
usepackage("amsmath");
