The polygonal path from $A$ through $B,C$ to $D$ has length $4+3+7=14$. By the triangle inequality, $AD\le14$. Among $14,19,23$, the only allowed value is $\boxed{AD=14\text{ cm}}$. The equality is possible with $A,B,C,D$ collinear in that order; the other lengths can be $AE=23,DE=19$.
