Since $3^2+4^2=5^2$, the triangle is right at $B$ and has area $\dfrac{1}{2}\cdot3\cdot4=6$. Also area equals $\dfrac{1}{2}\cdot5\cdot BH$, so $\boxed{BH=\dfrac{12}{5}}$.
