Each move changes square color. The starting square h 1 and target a 1 have opposite colors, so $A=0$ after $60$ moves. Target a 8 has the starting color. A path of $14$ moves reaches a 8; adding $23$ two-move backtracks makes a legal $60$-move path, so $B>0$. Therefore $\boxed{\dfrac{A}{B}=0}$.
