The angle at $A$ of the trapezoid is $2\alpha$, and by its isosceles symmetry $\angle ABC=2\alpha$. In triangle $ABM$, therefore, $\alpha+2\alpha+24^\circ=180^\circ$, giving $\alpha=52^\circ$. Thus $\boxed{\angle ABC=104^\circ}$.
