Write $ED=DC=x$ and place $D=(0,0)$, $E=(-\dfrac{\sqrt3}{2}x,\dfrac{x}{2})$, $C=(\dfrac{\sqrt3}{2}x,\dfrac{x}{2})$. The right angles and convexity place
