answer=sum(n%sum(map(int,str(n)))==0
           for n in range(100,1000))
print(answer)
# 180
\end{verbatim}

Three hops are up and three down. Of $\binom63=20$ unrestricted sequences, those that first reach level $-1$ correspond, by reflecting the prefix up to that first visit, to sequences with four ups and two downs; there are $\binom62=15$. Thus the valid count is $20-15=\boxed5$. They are UUUDDD, UUDUDD, UUDDUD, UDUUDD, UDUDUD.
