Unfold reflections by reflecting the box instead of the ray. The straight ray then has position $(t,t,t)$. It reaches a corner precisely when $t$ is simultaneously a multiple of 7,11,13. The least positive such value is $\operatorname{lcm}(7,11,13)=1001$. Its distance is $\boxed{1001\sqrt3}$.
