\end{asy}

Put $X=(0,0),E=(14,0),A=(0,h),L=(14,h),U=(12,0)$. Perpendicularity gives $(-12,h)\cdot(2,h)=0$, so $h^2=24$. The area squared is $(14h)^2=196\cdot24=\boxed{4704}$.
