If 80 degrees is the vertex angle, each base angle is 50 degrees. If 80 degrees is a base angle, the angles are 80, 80, 20 degrees, so the other selected angle can be 80 or 20 degrees. Thus the distinct possible values sum to $50+80+20=\boxed{150}$.
