For $P=(x,0)$, $A=(2,1)$, and $B=(-2,-2)$, the expression is $PA+PB$. The triangle inequality gives $PA+PB\ge AB=\sqrt{4^2+3^2}=5$. Segment $AB$ meets the $x$-axis at $(\dfrac{2}{3},0)$, so equality is attained. The minimum is $\boxed5$.
