\end{asy}

Conditional on $Y=y$, the probability is $\dfrac{2022-y}{2022}$. Averaging over the uniform interval gives $\dfrac{2022-E[Y]}{2022}=\dfrac{2022-2021}{2022}=\boxed{\dfrac{1}{2022}}$.
