Set $A=(0,0)$, $B=(s,0)$, $D=(0,s)$, $C=(s,s)$, so $P=(4,2)$ and $s>4$. The distance equation is $(s-4)^2+(s-2)^2=36$, or $s^2-6s-8=0$. Its roots are $3\pm\sqrt{17}$, and only the positive feasible root gives $\boxed{s=3+\sqrt{17}}$.
