\end{asy}

There are $\binom82=28$ pairs of vertices, of which $12$ are edges. All remaining pairs form diagonals, giving $\boxed{16}$. Equivalently, the six faces contribute two face diagonals each, and there are four space diagonals.
\begin{asy}
