Menelaus's theorem for transversal $Q,R,P$ gives $\dfrac{AQ}{QB}\cdot\dfrac{BP}{PC}\cdot\dfrac{CR}{RA}=1$. Hence $1\cdot\dfrac{BC+4}{4}\cdot\dfrac{3}{5}=1$, so $\boxed{BC=\dfrac{8}{3}}$.
\begin{asy}
