The components are $\mathbf a=(32,0)$ and $\mathbf b=(3\sqrt2,3\sqrt2)$. Therefore $|\mathbf a+\mathbf b|^2=(32+3\sqrt2)^2+(3\sqrt2)^2=1060+192\sqrt2$. The magnitude is $\boxed{\sqrt{1060+192\sqrt2}}$.
