\end{asy}

Write $AD=h$. The horizontal displacement from $A$ to $E$ is $3$, so $h^2+3^2=6^2$, giving $h^2=27$. Hence $AC^2=6^2+h^2=63$, and $AC=\boxed{3\sqrt7}$.
