\end{asy}

Every square in such a representation is at most $2017$, so its root is at most $44$. Enumerating these finitely many triples and retaining distinct positive sums therefore includes every representable integer and no others. This exact code gives $\boxed{1682}$:
\begin{verbatim}
values={a*a+b*b+c*c
        for a in range(45) for b in range(45) for c in range(45)
        if 0<a*a+b*b+c*c<2018}
assert len(values)==1682
\end{verbatim}

The face center is $O=(\dfrac{1}{2},\dfrac{1}{2},1)$. Therefore $BO^2=\dfrac{1}{4}+\dfrac{1}{4}+1=\dfrac{3}{2}$, so $BO=\dfrac{\sqrt6}{2}$ and $a+b=\boxed8$.
