size(7cm);
pair O=(0,0),A=dir(0),B=dir(60);draw(circle(O,1));draw(O--A--B--cycle);label("$O$",O,SW);label("$A$",A,E);label("$B$",B,N);
\end{asy}

The height is 1 and circumference 1, so $ r=\dfrac{1}{2\pi}$. Hence $ V=\pi r^2h=\boxed{\dfrac{1}{4\pi}}$.
\begin{asy}
