\end{asy}

Because $ 1.01>1 $, the powers increase strictly. Exact integer arithmetic gives $ 101^{69}<2\cdot100^{69}$ and $ 101^{70}>2\cdot100^{70}$. Thus $\boxed{N=70}$. These comparisons can be checked without floating-point rounding:
