The linear scale factor is $\dfrac{3}{5}$, so the area ratio is $\dfrac{9}{25}$. The first area is 6. The convergent sum is $ 6\dfrac{1}{1-\dfrac{9}{25}}=\boxed{\dfrac{75}{8}}$. 
