\end{asy}

The names below twenty and the tens names determine every value unambiguously. Exact enumeration gives the sole two-cycle $ 14\leftrightarrow16 $: FOURTEEN has 8 letters and SIXTEEN has 7. Hence $\boxed{x+y=30}$.
