If the first side is $ s $, its diagonal is $ s\sqrt2 $. The two areas are $ s^2 $ and $ 2s^2 $, so the ratio is $\boxed{\dfrac{1}{2}}$.
\begin{asy}
usepackage("amsmath");
size(7cm);
