Since $ r=\pi A^2 $, the condition gives $ A=\pi^3A^4 $. Divide by $ A>0 $ to obtain $ A^3=\pi^{-3}$, hence $ A=\dfrac{1}{\pi}$. The diameter is $\boxed{\dfrac{2}{\pi}}$.
