\end{asy}

If the side is $ s $, then $ BP=\dfrac{s}{21}$ and $ BQ=\dfrac{s}{18}$. The right triangle has area $\dfrac{s^2}{756}$, so the ratio is $\boxed{\dfrac{1}{756}}$.
