They satisfy $x^2+y^2=4225$ and $1\le y<\dfrac{65}{\sqrt2}$, hence $1\le y\le45$. Testing this bounded interval for square values of $4225-y^2$ gives exactly $\boxed{(63,16),(60,25),(56,33),(52,39)}$. The exact integer-square check below verifies completeness.
