\end{asy}

Connect the cells labelled 1 and 64 by a shortest grid path. It takes at most 7 horizontal and 7 vertical steps, hence at most 14 steps. If every adjacent difference were at most 4, the total difference along this path would be at most $14\cdot4=56$, by adding absolute differences. But its endpoints differ by 63. This contradiction proves the assertion.
