The retained folded angle is $ 180^\circ-30^\circ=150^\circ $, corresponding to 300 degrees of the original disk after unfolding. Its area before holes is $\dfrac{300}{360}\pi6^2=30\pi $. The five holes through two layers remove ten unit disks, area $ 10\pi $. The remaining area is $\boxed{20\pi}$.
