The two equations are inconsistent exactly when their left sides are proportional, $ ad=bc $, but the proportionality factor is not 3, since their right sides have ratio 3. Thus exclude the case $ c=3a,d=3b $. Directly counting this exact criterion gives $\boxed{48}$:
