from itertools import product
ans=sum(a*d==b*c and not(c==3*a and d==3*b)
 for a,b,c,d in product(range(1,6),repeat=4))
assert ans==48
\end{verbatim}

The side-foot conditions and the acute given angle make the triangle acute, so $ H $ lies inside. In isosceles triangle $ ABH $, equal sides $ AH,BH $ give $\angle HAB=\angle ABH $. These angles equal $ 90^\circ-\angle ABC $ and $ 90^\circ-\angle BAC $ respectively, so $\angle A=\angle B $. Their sum is 108 degrees, giving $\boxed{\angle ABC=54^\circ}$.
