\end{asy}

Without simultaneous grid-line crossings the count would be $ 20+16-1 $. There are $\gcd(20,16)-1=3 $ interior lattice points on the diagonal, where two crossings occur simultaneously and reduce that count by 1 each. Thus the number is $ 20+16-4=\boxed{32}$.
