\end{asy}

The separate surface areas sum to $6\cdot1^2+6\cdot2^2=30$. The contact area is at most the smaller face area 1, and each unit of contact removes two units of exposed area. Attaching the entire smaller face attains this bound. Hence the minimum is $\boxed{30-2=28}$.
