Place the cheetah at 0 and giraffe at $k>0$. Each permitted coordinate $x$ satisfies $|x|=2|x-k|$. Solving $x=\pm2(x-k)$ gives $x=2k$ or $x=\dfrac{2k}{3}$. Their separation is $\dfrac{4k}{3}=18$, hence $\boxed{k=\dfrac{27}{2}\text{ metres}}$.
