Write $a\le b\le c$ and $c=2017-a-b$. Then $1\le a\le672$, $b\le\lfloor\dfrac{2017-a}{2}\rfloor$, and the strict triangle inequality $a+b>c$ gives $b>\dfrac{2017-2a}{2}$. Thus, for each $a$, the number of possibilities is the nonnegative part of $\lfloor\dfrac{2017-a}{2}\rfloor-\max(a,\lfloor\dfrac{2017-2a}{2}\rfloor+1)+1$. Summing these 672 disjoint cases gives $\boxed{85008}$, as certified by this exact enumeration.
\begin{verbatim}
total = 0
for a in range(1,673):
    lo = max(a,(2017-2*a)//2+1)
    hi = (2017-a)//2
    total += max(0,hi-lo+1)
assert total == 85008
\end{verbatim}

\begin{asy}
