The distance to the line is $d_n=10^{100}\sin(\dfrac{\pi}{2^{n+2}})$. It decreases with $n$. On $[0,\dfrac{\pi}{2}]$, $\dfrac{2t}{\pi}\le\sin t\le t$. Thus $d_{331}\ge\dfrac{10^{100}}{2^{332}}>1$, whereas $d_{332}\le\dfrac{\pi10^{100}}{2^{334}}<\dfrac{22\cdot10^{100}}{7\cdot2^{334}}<1$. The integer comparisons are checked below. Hence the minimum is $\boxed{332}$.
