Choose any initial ordering and assign red the value $+1$, blue $-1$. Let $S_0=0,S_1,\ldots,S_{2n}=0$ be the prefix sums. Start immediately after a position $j$ where $S_j$ is minimal. Before wrapping around, each new prefix sum is $S_k-S_j\ge0$. After wrapping, it is $(S_{2n}-S_j)+S_k=S_k-S_j\ge0$. Thus every prefix has nonnegative red-minus-blue count, as required.
