\end{asy}

If the sphere radius is $r$, a face diagonal passes through a vertex center, a face center, and the opposite vertex center, so its length is $4r$. The cube edge is $2\sqrt2r$, and its volume is $16\sqrt2r^3$. Each cell contains $8\cdot\dfrac{1}{8}+6\cdot\dfrac{1}{2}=4$ spheres, with total volume $\dfrac{16\pi r^3}{3}$. The density is $\boxed{\dfrac{\pi}{3\sqrt2}}\approx74.05\%$.
