\end{asy}

If the angle between the sticks is $\theta$, the area is $\dfrac{1}{2}(6)(6)\sin\theta\le18$. Equality occurs at $\theta=90^\circ$, so the maximum is $\boxed{18}$ square feet.
\begin{asy}
