Place the triangle at $(0,0),(3,0),(0,4)$. Its hypotenuse has equation $ 4x+3y=12 $. The opposite square vertex is $(s,s)$, so $ 7s=12 $ and $\boxed{s=\dfrac{12}{7}}$.
