Every domino covers two squares, so a tiled board has even area. Board (B) has $15$ squares and cannot be tiled. Every other board has an even side length; partition each row or column along that direction into adjacent pairs. Thus the unique answer is $\boxed{\text{(B)}\ 3\times5}$.
