Similarity of $\triangle CLP$ and $\triangle CPF$ gives $CP^2=CL\cdot CF$. Hence $\boxed{CF=\dfrac{0.55^2}{0.25}=1.21}$ miles. Also $PL^2=CP^2-CL^2=0.3025-0.0625=0.24$, so $PL=\dfrac{\sqrt6}{5}\approx0.4899$, or $\boxed{0.49}$ mile.
\begin{asy}
usepackage("amsmath");
