\begin{enumerate}
\item $\angle ABH=180^\circ-90^\circ-30^\circ=\boxed{60^\circ}$.
\item $BH=a\sin30^\circ=\boxed{\dfrac a2}$ (the side opposite $30^\circ$ is half the hypotenuse).
\item $AH=a\cos30^\circ=\boxed{\dfrac{\sqrt3}2a}$.
\item A right triangle with angles $30^\circ,60^\circ,90^\circ$ (half of an equilateral triangle of side $a$).
