All sides must be positive, so $\ln x>0$, and then $\ln(3x)$ is the largest side, the hypotenuse.
\begin{asy}
usepackage("amsmath");
size(3cm);
defaultpen(fontsize(10pt));
pair A=(0,0),B=(3,0),C=(0,2);draw(A--B--C--cycle);draw((0.2,0)--(0.2,0.2)--(0,0.2));
