Define $\cot\theta=\dfrac{\cos\theta}{\sin\theta}$ (not as $\dfrac1{\tan\theta}$, which fails where $\tan$ is undefined). At $90^\circ$ the unit-circle point is $(0,1)$, so $\cos90^\circ=0$ and $\sin90^\circ=1$.
