So the polygon has $16131-2\cdot4032=8067$ sides of length $2$, and its perimeter is $\boxed{16134}$ inches.

$MA=MB=MC=4$, so $C$ lies on the circle with diameter $AB$, and $\angle ACB=90^\circ$ (Thales). With $AB=8$:
\begin{asy}
usepackage("amsmath");
