\[\tan^2x-\sin^2x=\dfrac{\sin^2x}{\cos^2x}-\sin^2x=\dfrac{\sin^2x\left(1-\cos^2x\right)}{\cos^2x}=\dfrac{\sin^2x}{\cos^2x}\cdot\sin^2x=\tan^2x\sin^2x.\ \blacksquare\]

