Let the edges be $a\le b\le c$. The condition $abc=2(ab+bc+ca)$ is equivalent to
\[\dfrac1a+\dfrac1b+\dfrac1c=\dfrac12.\]
Since $\dfrac1a<\dfrac12\le\dfrac3a$, we have $3\le a\le6$.
