question:
In the figure, $\overline{US}$ and $\overline{UT}$ are line segments each of length $2$, and $m\angle TUS=60^\circ$. Arcs $TR$ and $SR$ are each one-sixth of a circle with radius $2$, and they bend inward, into the region. What is the area of the region shown, bounded by $\overline{UT}$, arc $TR$, arc $RS$ and $\overline{SU}$?

\begin{asy}
usepackage("amsmath");
