\[\angle OBC+\angle OCB=\left(60^\circ-\angle ABD\right)+\angle BCE=60^\circ,\]
so $\angle BOC=120^\circ$. Hence $\angle EOD=\angle BOC=120^\circ$ (vertical angles) and $\angle DOC=60^\circ$.

