\[AC=AP+PQ+QC=3s,\qquad s=\dfrac{42\sqrt2}{3}=14\sqrt2.\]
The area is $s^2=\left(14\sqrt2\right)^2=392$, answer $\boxed{\textbf{(B) } 392}$.

