question:
Twenty toothpicks, each $6$ cm long, form the figure shown: a rectangle, $3$ toothpicks long and $1$ toothpick wide, with an equilateral triangle built outward on each of the six toothpicks of its two long sides. What is the total area of the figure? Express your answer as a decimal to the nearest hundredth.

