The arc is $\dfrac{68}{360}$ of the circumference $2\pi\cdot2\pi=4\pi^2$, so its length is
\[\dfrac{68}{360}\cdot4\pi^2=\dfrac{17}{90}\cdot4\pi^2=\boxed{\dfrac{34\pi^2}{45}}\approx7.46.\]

\begin{asy}
