question:
\begin{enumerate}
\item[(a)] Someone had the idea of making a website on February $1$, $2002$, and achieved it on May $1$, $2003$. How many months did it take?
\item[(b)] Let $m$ be the answer to part (a). Evaluate $m+5\div24-8$.
