question:
There are $5$ yellow pegs, $4$ red pegs, $3$ green pegs, $2$ blue pegs and $1$ orange peg to be placed on a triangular peg board with $15$ holes. The holes form $5$ horizontal rows containing $1,2,3,4,5$ holes from top to bottom, lined up on the left so that they also form $5$ vertical columns containing $5,4,3,2,1$ holes from left to right:

\begin{asy}
usepackage("amsmath");
size(3cm);
defaultpen(fontsize(10pt));
