\textbf{The point $D$.} The points of line $BO$ are $t\,O=\left(10t,\dfrac{25\sqrt6}{6}t\right)$, and the points of line $AC$ are $A+u(C-A)=\left(\dfrac{76}5+\dfrac{24}5u,\ \dfrac{48\sqrt6}{5}(1-u)\right)$. Equating coordinates,
