label("(not to scale)",(0,-3.2),S,fontsize(7pt));
\end{asy}

(The figure shows the critical case $r=2020.5$ for $d=\dfrac12$: the circle about $P$ touches the inner circle and reaches the outer circle, whose points are good.) The smallest distance is $\boxed{\textbf{(A) }0.5}$.

