Let the line $AI$ meet the circumcircle again at $M$; since $AI$ bisects angle $A$, $M$ is the midpoint of the arc $BC$ not containing $A$. Let $F$ be the foot of the perpendicular from $I$ to $AB$, so $IF=r$. Write $A$, $B$, $C$ also for the angles of the triangle.

\begin{asy}
usepackage("amsmath");
