Geometrically, $f'(t)=0$ says that the vector $(t-10,t^2-10)$ is perpendicular to the tangent direction $(1,2t)$, that is, $PQ$ is normal to the parabola at $Q$, as expected at the closest point.

Numerically $r_3\approx 3.31769$, and
