Since $23$ is one of them, $n$ is one of $9,\ 14,\ 36,\ 56$ (from $2n+5$, $2n-5$, $\dfrac {n}{2}+5$, $\dfrac {n}{2}-5$ respectively). Check whether $12$ is also a possible reply:
\begin{itemize}
