Place $P=(-4,0)$ and $Q=(4,0)$. The area is $\dfrac{1}{2}\cdot8\cdot h=12$, where $h$ is the distance from $R$ to line $PQ$, so $h=3$: $R$ lies on one of the lines $y=3$, $y=-3$.
