\[
MA+MC\ge AC\qquad\text{and}\qquad MB+MD\ge BD,
\]
with equality in the first exactly when $M$ is on segment $AC$, and in the second exactly when $M$ is on segment $BD$. Adding,
\[
MA+MB+MC+MD\ge AC+BD,
\]
and equality holds exactly when $M$ lies on both diagonals, i.e.\ $M=O$. For $M=O$ the sum is $AC+BD$.

