\[
2\left(x+\dfrac{80}{x}\right)\ge2\cdot2\sqrt{x\cdot\dfrac{80}{x}}=4\sqrt{80}=16\sqrt5
\]
by AM-GM, with equality when $x=\dfrac{80}{x}$, i.e.\ for the square of side $\sqrt{80}=4\sqrt5$.

