\begin{itemize}
\item the curved surface of the hemisphere: half of $4\pi r^2$, that is $2\pi\cdot5^2=50\pi$;
\item the lateral surface of the cylinder: $2\pi rh=2\pi\cdot5\cdot10=100\pi$;
\item the bottom disc of the cylinder: $\pi\cdot5^2=25\pi$.
