label("\mbox{}",(min(currentpicture,user=true)+max(currentpicture,user=true))/2,black); // keeps the text after the figure black when LaTeX typesets the labels inline
\end{asy}

(b) The graph is the horizontal ray $y=3$ starting at $(0,3)$ (included) and going to the right. It is a function (a constant one), with range $\boxed{\{3\}}$.

\begin{asy}
usepackage("amsmath");
size(4.5cm,3cm,IgnoreAspect);
