Quadrilateral $APCD$ is the rectangle minus triangles $ABP$ and $BCP$:
\begin{itemize}
\item $[ABP]=\dfrac{1}{2}\cdot AB\cdot(\text{height of }P\text{ above }AB)=\dfrac{1}{2}\cdot20\cdot1=10$;
\item $[BCP]=\dfrac{1}{2}\cdot BC\cdot(\text{distance from }P\text{ to }BC)=\dfrac{1}{2}\cdot6\cdot8=24$.
