So $[APCD]=20\cdot6-10-24=\boxed{86}$.

Put the prism in coordinates as $[0,6]\times[0,4]\times[0,3]$, with the segment from $(0,0,0)$ to $(6,4,3)$.

\begin{asy}
usepackage("amsmath");
