The data are consistent:
\[
k^2=h^2+\left(\dfrac {b}{2}\right)^2=144+25=169=13^2,\qquad l^2=h^2+\left(\dfrac {a}{2}\right)^2=144+81=225=15^2 .
\]
The volume is
\[
V=\dfrac{1}{3}\cdot(\text{base area})\cdot h=\dfrac{1}{3}\cdot18\cdot10\cdot12=\boxed{720\text{ cm}^3}.
\]

question:
